## Reactive Hooks (Use in Render)

**IMPORTANT: Use these hooks in render, NOT store methods.**

### `useCurrentRowSync` - For Forms (ALWAYS for form fields)

```typescript
import { useCurrentRowSync, useIsStoreDirty, useIsStorePosting } from '@/lib/common/store';

function EntityForm({ store }: { store: Store<Entity> }) {
  const row = useCurrentRowSync(store);  // ✅ Sync mode prevents cursor jumping
  const isDirty = useIsStoreDirty(store);
  const isPosting = useIsStorePosting(store);

  if (!row) return null;

  return (
    <form>
      <TextInput label="Name" store={store} attributeCode="name" required />
      <Button disabled={isPosting || !isDirty}>Save</Button>
    </form>
  );
}
```

**Why sync mode?** Sync mode ensures immediate UI updates when typing, preventing cursor jumping in form fields.

### `useDBRows` vs `useRows` - For Lists

```typescript
import { useDBRows, useRows, useIsStoreLoading } from '@/lib/common/store';

// Use useDBRows for list pages (all rows from DB)
function EntityList({ store }: { store: Store<Entity> }) {
  const rows = useDBRows(store);
  const isLoading = useIsStoreLoading(store);

  if (isLoading) return <Spinner />;

  return (
    <ul>
      {rows.map((row) => (
        <li key={row._id}>{row.name}</li>
      ))}
    </ul>
  );
}

// Use useRows when store includes new/unsaved rows
function EditableGrid({ store }: { store: Store<Entity> }) {
  const rows = useRows(store);  // May include status 'I' (new)
  
  return rows.map((row) => (
    <tr key={row._id ?? row._cid}>
      <td>{row.name?.toUpperCase()}</td>  // Must use optional chaining
    </tr>
  ));
}
```

### `useRowValue` - For Table Cells

```typescript
import { useRowValue } from '@/lib/common/store';

function StatusCell({ store, rowId }: { store: Store<Entity>; rowId: string }) {
  const status = useRowValue(store, rowId, 'status');
  return <Badge>{status}</Badge>;
}
```

### Hooks Reference

| Hook | Purpose | Return Type |
|------|---------|------------|
| `useCurrentRowSync` | Current row (sync, for forms) | `Row<T> \| undefined` |
| `useCurrentRow` | Current row (async) | `Row<T> \| undefined` |
| `useDBRows` | All rows from DB | `ReadonlyArray<DBRow<T>>` |
| `useRows` | All rows (includes unsaved) | `ReadonlyArray<Row<T>>` |
| `useRowValue` | Single field from specific row | `T[K] \| undefined` |
| `useIsStoreLoading` | Loading state | `boolean` |
| `useIsStorePosting` | Saving state | `boolean` |
| `useIsStoreDirty` | Has unsaved changes | `boolean` |
| `useStoreRowCount` | Total row count (with pagination) | `number \| undefined` |

